</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Adaptive Kernel Design for Bayesian Optimization Is a Piece of CAKE with LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Additional Results</span></a>
