<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 1</span>: </span><span id="S5.T1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Average rank (<math id="S5.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>) <math id="S5.T1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> standard error on HPOBench over 20 random seeds.</span></figcaption>
